  m_text: "To whoever finds this\n\nI\u2019ve been here for\u2026 I don\u2019t know.\nThe
    clocks don\u2019t move anymore.\nThe air feels heavy\n\n\nI keep hearing a boy
    calling for help.\nI followed him once, there was no boy.\nJust another fog-covered
    house that looked like mine.\n\n\nPlease, if you came looking for someone, turn
    back.\nThere\u2019s nothing left of them. Or you"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
