      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "This style\u2026 it\u2019s familiar.\n\nAdel always drew like this. Messy
    lines, strange monsters, and that same old sun in the corner.\n\nI remember asking
    him once why he kept drawing everything this way. He just smiled and said, \u201CBecause
    it looks better like this.\u201D\n\nIt still looks childish\u2026 but somehow,
    I understand what he was trying to show me."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
